# Applies to builds whose context is the repository root, which is the landing
# image. It copies software/landing/ and training/ only, so everything heavy
# below is dead weight in the context.
#
# software/rpi-image/ alone reaches tens of gigabytes once a local SD card image
# has been built, and all of it was being sent to the daemon on every build.

# pi-gen checkout and built images
software/rpi-image/

# Submodules and vendored trees the landing image does not copy
software/OpenPLC/
software/FUXA/
software/stm32/build/

# Large trees unrelated to any image
doc/
hardware/

.git/
.devcontainer/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
